ith scenes and assets, inside the official demo repository. Match the project branch to your Godot version.","text","Access type","value","playable","demo","Play or run",[82],{"_49":83,"_25":84,"_73":85},"Play Dodge the Creeps","https://godotengine.github.io/godot-demo-projects/2d/dodge_the_creeps/","Official browser build. Use the keyboard; a native Godot run can perform better.","Game platform","Browser","Build story / tutorial",[91],"tutorial",{"_49":92,"_25":93,"_73":-7},"Follow the official tutorial","https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/getting_started/first_2d_game/index.html","list","Study this workflow","ordered",true,[99,100,101,102],"Play the reference and identify movement, spawning, scoring, and restart behavior.","Follow the official tutorial and open the completed project for comparison.","Ask an agent for one small change, such as a difficulty curve or a temporary shield.","Play through a complete start, loss, and restart cycle after each change.","AI workflow / foundation context","Ask a coding agent to explain the existing project, then change one mechanic at a time and compare the result with the playable reference.","aiUse","guidance","Creation category","Human-authored engine foundation — not an AI-created game","category","provenance","Track","2D","track","metadata","Engine","Godot · 2D","engine","lead","2d",[99,100,101,102],{"_49":92,"_25":93},{"_49":83,"_25":84,"_17":78,"_73":85},{"_49":71,"_25":72,"_73":74},[125,126,127,128],"godot-engine","godot-demo-projects","godot-command-line","codex",{"_130":131},"documents",{"_132":133,"_134":135},"en",[137,141,142,143,140,144,145,146,147,148,149,150,151,152,153,154,155,156,157,158,159,160,161,162,163,164,165,166,167,168,169,170,171,172,173,174,175,139,176,138,177,178,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194],"zh",[136,137,138,139,140],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game